    "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">IIP301 · Chapter 2 · Session 3</span>\n<h2>Session 3 — Chapter 1: Key Issues in International Payments (cont)</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM syllabus 12378 · session plan</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">IIP301 · Chương 2 · Buổi 3</span>\n<h2>Buổi 3 — Chapter 1: Key Issues in International Payments (cont)</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: syllabus FLM 12378 · kế hoạch buổi</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Type</span><span class=\"v\">Offline</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">LO</span><span class=\"v\">LO1, LO2</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">ITU</span><span class=\"v\">T,U</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Slides in this lesson</span><span class=\"v\">none from FLM</span></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Hình thức</span><span class=\"v\">Offline</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">LO</span><span class=\"v\">LO1, LO2</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">ITU</span><span class=\"v\">T,U</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Slide trong bài</span><span class=\"v\">FLM không có</span></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>What this session covers (FLM, verbatim)</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Nội dung buổi học (FLM, nguyên văn)</h3></div>\n<p>Chapter 1: Key Issues in International Payments (cont)</p>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Materials to read</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Tài liệu cần đọc</h3></div>\n<p>Textbooks, workbooks, PPT presentation, and other resources</p>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Student's tasks</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Nhiệm vụ sinh viên</h3></div>\n<p>Teacher's Presentation, Discussion/Edunext, Exercises.</p>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Constructive questions — answer them yourself first</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Câu hỏi kiến tạo — tự trả lời trước</h3></div>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>HCM1</strong> — What are the common international payment methods?</li>\n<li><strong>HCM2</strong> — Which are the characteristics of each payment method? Provided examples for the characteristics</li>\n<li><strong>HCM3</strong> — According to the security and risk criteria, which among the payment method offer advantages for the importer? Why? Establish arguments with practical evidence</li>\n<li><strong>HCM4</strong> — According to the security and risk criteria, which among the payment method offer advantages for the exporter? Why? Establish arguments with practical evidence</li>\n<li><strong>HCM5</strong> — For each payment method, which questions to be addressed in concern of the importer?</li>\n<li><strong>HCM6</strong> — How would you suggest to resolve these questions for importer?</li>\n<li><strong>HCM7</strong> — For each payment method, which questions to be addressed in concern of the exporter?</li>\n<li><strong>HCM8</strong> — How would you suggest to resolve these questions for exporter?</li>\n<li><strong>HCM9</strong> — Besides the payment method presented, what are other methods that you may know? Present a few characteristics</li>\n<li><strong>HCM10</strong> — Why it is said the L/C is the most common payment method for international trade?</li>\n<li><strong>HCM11</strong> — For specific domestic trades, which methods would commonly proposed by the buyer/seller?</li>\n<li><strong>HCM12</strong> — Regarding each concern of the parties in trade (from previous chapter), which payment method could resolve their concerns?</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Detailed lecture and 🎬 video for this session: coming later. For now follow the slides, the materials and the tasks above.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Bài giảng chi tiết và 🎬 video cho buổi này: sẽ bổ sung sau. Trước mắt học theo slide, tài liệu và nhiệm vụ ở trên.</div></div>"
