    "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">IIP301 · Chapter 4 · Session 7</span>\n<h2>Session 7 — Chapter 3: Introducing the Basic Terms of Payment (cont)</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM syllabus 12378 · session plan</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">IIP301 · Chương 4 · Buổi 7</span>\n<h2>Buổi 7 — Chapter 3: Introducing the Basic Terms of Payment (cont)</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: syllabus FLM 12378 · kế hoạch buổi</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Type</span><span class=\"v\">Offline</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">LO</span><span class=\"v\">LO4</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">ITU</span><span class=\"v\">T,U</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Slides in this lesson</span><span class=\"v\">none from FLM</span></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Hình thức</span><span class=\"v\">Offline</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">LO</span><span class=\"v\">LO4</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">ITU</span><span class=\"v\">T,U</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Slide trong bài</span><span class=\"v\">FLM không có</span></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>What this session covers (FLM, verbatim)</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Nội dung buổi học (FLM, nguyên văn)</h3></div>\n<p>Chapter 3: Introducing the Basic Terms of Payment (cont)</p>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Materials to read</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Tài liệu cần đọc</h3></div>\n<p>Textbooks, workbooks, PPT presentation, and other resources</p>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Student's tasks</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Nhiệm vụ sinh viên</h3></div>\n<p>Teacher's Presentation, Discussion/Edunext, Exercises.</p>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Constructive questions — answer them yourself first</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Câu hỏi kiến tạo — tự trả lời trước</h3></div>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>HCM1</strong> — Why contracts important in international trade?</li>\n<li><strong>HCM2</strong> — What issues considered in contracts?</li>\n<li><strong>HCM3</strong> — How to balance parties' interest from contract provisions?</li>\n<li><strong>HCM4</strong> — What are the basic contract provisions?</li>\n<li><strong>HCM5</strong> — Which issues could arise from international contracts?</li>\n<li><strong>HCM6</strong> — In case of contract dispute, how would the parties resolve?</li>\n<li><strong>HCM7</strong> — When does buyer have claims against seller? How would they resolve?</li>\n<li><strong>HCM8</strong> — When does seller have claims against buyer? How would they resolve?</li>\n<li><strong>HCM9</strong> — What is each party's last resort in case of dispute?</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Detailed lecture and 🎬 video for this session: coming later. For now follow the slides, the materials and the tasks above.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Bài giảng chi tiết và 🎬 video cho buổi này: sẽ bổ sung sau. Trước mắt học theo slide, tài liệu và nhiệm vụ ở trên.</div></div>"
