"><h3>Câu hỏi kiến tạo — tự trả lời trước</h3></div>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>HCM1</strong> — What is Incoterms? Why they important in international trade?</li>\n<li><strong>HCM2</strong> — Why are Incoterms need to be considered for international payment?</li>\n<li><strong>HCM3</strong> — What are the differences between Incoterms version?</li>\n<li><strong>HCM4</strong> — When to use each Incoterm considering the parties' costs and risks?</li>\n<li><strong>HCM5</strong> — How to decide the Incoterm for different payment methods?</li>\n<li><strong>HCM6</strong> — How to decide the Incoterm for contract provisions?</li>\n<li><strong>HCM7</strong> — Which Incoterm benefit to the buyer/importer? In which scenario?</li>\n<li><strong>DN1</strong> — What is Incoterms? Why they are important in international trade?</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Detailed lecture and 🎬 video for this session: coming later. For now follow the slides, the materials and the tasks above.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Bài giảng chi tiết và 🎬 video cho buổi này: sẽ bổ sung sau. Trước mắt học theo slide, tài liệu và nhiệm vụ ở trên.</div></div>"
